<title>BELARUS: Belarus Jan-Aug GDP rises 0.4 pct vs year ago.</title>
<headline>Belarus Jan-Aug GDP rises 0.4 pct vs year ago.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belarus's gross domestic product</p>
<p>for the first eight months of the year totalled 85.898 trillion</p>
<p>Belarussian roubles, up 0.4 percent from a year ago in</p>
<p>inflation-adjusted terms, the Statistics Ministry said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p> BELARUS GDP		   AUG 96    JULY 96    AUG 95</p>
<p> month-on-month pct change +28	 +2	   +14</p>
<p> year-on-year pct change   +1	  +3	   -15</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
